>      case USB_ID(0x21b4, 0x0081): /* AudioQuest DragonFly */
>      case USB_ID(0x2912, 0x30c8): /* Audioengine D1 */
> +    case USB_ID(0x1224, 0x2a25): /* Jieli Technology USB PHY 2.0 */
>          return true;
>      }

This looks fine.


